{"id":"28ce328b7cb2f9d8","group":"62","path":"62/62-thm-RCA0-closure.md","title":"RCA0 Forms Function Preimages","display":"thm-RCA0-closure — RCA0 Forms Function Preimages","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-thm-RCA0-closure","aliases":["62-thm-RCA0-closure"],"display":"thm-RCA0-closure — RCA0 Forms Function Preimages","depends_on":["[[62-df-RCA0]]","[[62-df-coded-function]]","[[62-df-derivability]]","[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definitions II.1.4–II.1.5; §II.3","source_pages":[64,69,70],"source_pdf_pages":[82,87,88]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-thm-RCA0-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-thm-RCA0-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-RCA0-closure — RCA0 Forms Function Preimages"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definitions II.1.4–II.1.5; §II.3"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>64</span><span>69</span><span>70</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>82</span><span>87</span><span>88</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a>，Fun 与图成员见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a>；UC 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{S_2}\">\\(\\vdash_{S_2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,Y,X\">\\(f,Y,X\\)</span> 为集合变量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}RCA0\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\bigl(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,N,N)\\to\\exists X\\forall n[n\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\exists m(\\langle n,m\\rangle_N\\in f\\land m\\in Y)]\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}RCA0\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\bigl(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,N,N)\\to\\exists X\\forall n[n\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\exists m(\\langle n,m\\rangle_N\\in f\\land m\\in Y)]\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由总性和唯一性，存在式等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall m(\\langle n,m\\rangle_N\\in f\\to m\\in Y)\">\\(\\forall m(\\langle n,m\\rangle_N\\in f\\to m\\in Y)\\)</span>。分别是 Σ⁰₁ 与 Π⁰₁ 表达，故 Δ⁰₁ 理解给出逆像 X。这里不能以同样理由推出任意 f 的值域；后者正是 ACA₀ 的特征原则。本结论是 Δ⁰₁ 理解的明确应用，不把集合论逆像操作的元层存在当作对象层证明。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definitions II.1.4–II.1.5; §II.3；纸面页 64, 69, 70；PDF 页 82, 87, 88。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-RCA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-coded-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"98c3cbeb95500b53","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RCA}_0$ 见 [[62-df-RCA0]]，Fun 与图成员见 [[62-df-coded-function]]；UC 和 $\\vdash_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。$f,Y,X$ 为集合变量。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RCA}_0$ 见 [[62-df-RCA0]]，Fun 与图成员见 [[62-df-coded-function]]；UC 和 $\\vdash_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。$f,Y,X$ 为集合变量。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RCA}_0$ 见 [[62-df-RCA0]]，Fun 与图成员见 [[62-df-coded-function]]；UC 和 $\\vdash_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。$f,Y,X$ 为集合变量。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"98c3cbeb95500b53","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RCA}_0$ 见 [[62-df-RCA0]]，Fun 与图成员见 [[62-df-coded-function]]；UC 和 $\\vdash_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。$f,Y,X$ 为集合变量。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{RCA}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{S_2}","display":false},{"tex":"f,Y,X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}RCA0\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\bigl(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,N,N)\\to\\exists X\\forall n[n\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\exists m(\\langle n,m\\rangle_N\\in f\\land m\\in Y)]\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall m(\\langle n,m\\rangle_N\\in f\\to m\\in Y)","display":false}],"bytes":1490,"backlinks":[{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-thm-RCA0-closure|RCA0 Forms Function Preimages]]"}],"outgoing":["dd5e8930337c8b20","c156c03daff0aff0","98c3cbeb95500b53","4c6d2d9f1999915f"]}